  "limitations": [
    "Exact text reuse intentionally misses when speech recognition writes the same recording differently; the missed native pair is retained as evidence. No fuzzy or cross-user action reuse.",
    "Initial interpretations still use a model. Current chat first interpretations were 11.163 and 12.713 seconds; repeated chat finals were 2.466 and 2.959 seconds. E5.2 original median<=1s/p95<=2s remains open.",
    "Native exact-repeat trials were off-state verified no-ops. Live chat separately exercised real on/off effects. No physical microphone/playback/owner acceptance claimed.",
    "Protocol invalidations and grant/STOP races were tested in isolation; owner device names, accounts and group membership were not modified for testing.",
    "A parallel managed core update preserved all ten owned sources. Samples retain actual image identities; no same-image general performance benchmark claimed."
  ],
